        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DWD B2960, 2-3/4\" x  2-1/2\" Screen Door Spring Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFull Surface Single Acting Spring Hinge for Screen Doors. Door flange is surface applied to door. Jamb flange is surface applied to door jamb.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDWD B2960 Screen Door Spring Hinge permit doors automatically return to the closed position (Self Closing). Packaged with #6 x 3/4\" mounting screws. The spring tension is not adjustable.\r\n<!-- If you need an adjustable tension hinge use <a href=\"/products/2-3-4-x-2-3-4-full-surface-screen-door-spring-hinge-pair-bommer-2920\"><b>Bommer 2920</b></a>. -->\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the DWD B2960 Screen Door Spring Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Height: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Non-Adjustable Tension</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Type: Full Surface</li>\r\n<li>Door flange surface applied</li>\r\n<li>Jamb flange  surface applied</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-B2960-specifications.pdf?v=1774586590\" target=\"new\"><b>DWD B2960 Dimensional  Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>**Comparable to Discontinued</b> <a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/2-3-4-x-2-3-4-full-surface-screen-door-spring-hinge-pair-bommer-2960\"><b>Bommer 2960 Screen Door Spring Hinge.</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Pair (2 Hinges).</b>\r\n</p>",
